# Base: 40TPS Batches 1-4 + 85TPS Batches 1-4
#
# Goal: stop re-uploading the entire committed KV prefix for every layer and
# every speculative verification window.
#
# Adds per-layer persistent device K/V mirrors on the primary Vulkan device.
# Layout: [kvHead][maxSeq][headDim]. Only newly committed positions are copied.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0041_persistent_device_spec_kv_mirror.patch

